44...Rf5+.} (44... Rf5+ 45. Kg3 (45. Ke2 Rg8 46. g7 Kh5 47. Rg2 Rf3 48. Bd4 Kh6 49. c3 Kh5 50. Rg1 Kh6 51. Rg4 Kh5 52. Rxe4 Rf5 53. Re6 Kg6 54. Rxc6 Re8+ 55. Kd2 Rh5 56. Re6 Rh2+ 57. Kd3 Rh3+ 58. Be3 Rd8+ 59. Ke4 Kf7 60. Rc6 )(45. Ke3 $1 Rf3+ 46. Ke2 Rxc3 47. f7 Rd8 48. g7 Rxc2+ 49. Ke1 Rc1+ 50. Kf2 Rc2+ (50... e3+ 51. Kg2 e2 52. g8=Q Rxg8 53. fxg8=Q Rg1+ 54. Kf3 Rxg4 55. Qh8+ Kg6 56. Qe8+ Kf5 57. Qf7+ Ke5 58. Kxg4 )51. Kg3 Rc3+ 52. Kh4 Rc1 (52... Rd1 53. g8=N+ )53. g8=Q Rh1+ 54. Kg3 Rg1+ 55. Kf4 Rf1+ 56. Ke5 Rd5+ 57. Ke6 Rf6+ 58. Kxf6 Rd6+ )Rf3+ 46. Kh4 Rd8 47. f7 Rd5 )45. g7 {A well-played game by Kasparov, from both
the chess and the psychological point of view. Eine gut gespielte Partie von
